---
source: tests/exec.rs
expression: s
---
a requires entry that could be read as an option
  exit 2  refusing: is not a package name (ASCII letters, digits and `@._+-`, not starting with `-` or `.`), so it was not passed to `pacman -Q` (-Syu) [R3]

git status on a relative path
  exit 2  refusing: `git status` is only run on an absolute path free of `..` (relative/repo) [R3]

PacmanQuery not installed
  exit 2  refusing: `pacman` is not installed in any of /usr/bin, /usr/local/bin. ricepilot runs a subprocess only by absolute path and does not look anywhere else — `PATH` is not consulted (pacman) [R3]

