  exit 2  refusing: `git` is not installed in any of /usr/bin, /usr/local/bin. ricepilot runs a subprocess only by absolute path and does not look anywhere else — `PATH` is not consulted (git) [R3]

Hyprctl in the sandbox
  exit 2  refusing: `hyprctl` reaches the live session, and RICEPILOT_SANDBOX is set: inside the test sandbox ricepilot never runs it (only an explicit RICEPILOT_LIVE_TESTS=1 lets a test run the real one) (hyprctl) [R1]

